{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20054","headline":"戏赠无本 一 · 孟郊","name":"戏赠无本 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安秋声乾，木叶相号悲。\n瘦僧卧冰凌，嘲咏含金痍。\n金痍非战痕，峭病方在兹。\n诗骨耸东野，诗涛涌退之。\n有时踉跄行，人惊鹤阿师。\n可惜李杜死，不见此狂痴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}